          "effect": "Changes the spatial frequency of the input complex exponential wave. This shifts the target frequency marker on the filter's response curve, altering the amplitude scaling and phase shift of the output wave.",
          "teaches": "Demonstrates how different spatial frequencies experience different gains and phase shifts depending on where they land on the filter's transfer function."
        },
        {
          "id": "filterType",
          "type": "toggle",
          "label": "Filter Mode",
          "range": [
